sc('caught','You and Ravi robbed a jewellery store. You’re caught, in separate rooms. Your goal here: fewer prison years. You control your statement.',{'type':'cards','items':[{'title':'You ↔ Ravi','lines':['Neither sees the other’s final statement. No contact or enforceable agreement.','One fictional decision. Later switches are what-ifs, not another encounter.']}]},[ch('See the deal','deal')],mood='speaking')
